 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "customerIds is a list of distinct ids, movies[i] the chronological list of movie ids watched by customerIds[i], and k >= 1. The key of a customer who watched at least k movies is the set of their last k entries (duplicates collapse, order ignored); customers with fewer than k entries belong to no group. Customers with equal keys form a group. Return every group with at least two members as a list of ids in input order; groups are ordered by the input position of their first member.",
